            "line": 52,
            "text": "theorem rho_second_moment_scale {l a b : ℝ} (hl : 0 < l) (hab : a < b) :\n    IntegratedMeanBalances.moment 2\n      (PressureStream.rho (l * a) (l * b) (mul_lt_mul_of_pos_left hab hl)) =\n      l ^ 2 * IntegratedMeanBalances.moment 2 (PressureStream.rho a b hab)"
